                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Tower.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1904-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                15, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs Mr. Tower to convey to the Emperor the President’s profound
                    appreciation of his generous initiative and powerful cooperation in the matter
                    of Chinese neutrality.)</p>
            </div>
